docs {
  # Spacelift API

  Every operation in the Spacelift GraphQL API, one request per operation.

  ## Start here

  1. Fill in `SPACELIFT_ENDPOINT`, `SPACELIFT_API_KEY_ID` and `SPACELIFT_API_KEY_SECRET` in the **My Account** environment (top-right dropdown).
  2. Send **Auth → Get Token**. It stores the `jwt` that every other request authenticates with.

  Tokens last a few hours — send it again when requests start coming back unauthorized.

  See the [README](https://github.com/spacelift-io/spacelift-api-bruno#setup) for detailed setup instructions.

  ## What's New

  ✚ added · ✎ corrected · ⚠ deprecated · ✖ removed

  **2026-09-15**

  - ✖ Runs → Delete Run State Summary
  - ✖ Runs → Delete Run Summary
  - ✖ Runs → Summarize Run
  - ✖ Runs → Summarize Run State
  - ⚠ Blueprints → Deployments → List Deployments — Use searchTemplateDeployments instead
  - ⚠ Blueprints → Deployments → Get Deployment — Use templateDeployment instead
  - ⚠ Blueprints → Deployments → Create Deployment — Use templateDeploymentCreate instead
  - ⚠ Blueprints → Deployments → Update Deployment — Use templateDeploymentUpdate instead
  - ⚠ Blueprints → Deployments → Delete Deployment — Use templateDeploymentDelete instead
  - ⚠ Blueprints → Versioned Groups → List Versioned Groups — Use searchTemplates instead
  - ⚠ Blueprints → Versioned Groups → Get Versioned Group — Use template instead
  - ⚠ Blueprints → Versioned Groups → Create Versioned Group — Use templateCreate instead

  _… and 697 earlier changes — see the [full changelog](https://github.com/spacelift-io/spacelift-api-bruno/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md)._
